Output command.gif

Set FontSize 10
Set Width 1600
Set Height 630
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 15

Env LC_ALL "C.UTF-8"
Env LANG "C.UTF-8"
Env LANGUAGE "en_US:en"

Type "# Show command options and filesystem limits reference table"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "filenamelength --help"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 20s


